{
  "_comment": "Copy to .odoosh.json. Used by tools/odoosh_build_log.py and /odoo-build-triage.",

  "project": "myproject",

  "_ssh": "There is deliberately no ssh_user here. On Odoo.sh the SSH user is the BUILD ID, so it changes with every build. Copy the whole '<build_id>@<host>' line from the build page's SSH box and pass it as --host. Click 'Allow my IP' on that same panel first: port 22 is IP-allowlisted, and an un-allowed IP times out rather than being refused.",

  "_optional": "Set only if yours differs from the default.",
  "check_context": "odoo.sh"
}
